Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "CyclistWithRollingObjectOnRoad" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:actor1 a :Cyclist ;
    :description "Cyclist riding on the road" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Rolling ball on the road" .

:evidence1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition ;
    :description "Foggy weather reducing visibility" .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision between cyclist and rolling ball" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Cyclist may intrude into adjacent lane due to ball" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Fog reduces visibility of cyclist and ball" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.80"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Potential collision between cyclist and rolling ball
Severity Score: 0.75

**Risk 2:**
Description: Cyclist may intrude into adjacent lane due to ball
Severity Score: 0.60

**Risk 3:**
Description: Fog reduces visibility of cyclist and ball
Severity Score: 0.80